title: Add report-only Subsystem Benchmarks filtering

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Add an independent CI job that reports whether a pull request affects the five
      Subsystem Benchmarks through local Cargo dependencies or shared build inputs.
      The selector verifies the actual CI merge checkout and proposes a full run for
      unknown inputs or errors. All five benchmark jobs continue to run regardless
      of the report. The change includes regression tests and rollout documentation;
      it does not enable skipping. No crates require publishing.
crates: []
